      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "My family embarked on understanding Solar panels for our new build and were referred to Guy, Jared and the team at Modergy.  Guy was extremely understanding of our lack of knowledge and the amount of questions we had about solar and the process in general as it was all foreign to us.  Jared was outstanding with installation, clean and efficient and always ontime.  We were kept up-to-date at every stage of the way and Guy and Jared went over and above to finish the job as professionally as they started.  We would recommend Modergy to any customers looking for a solar solution.",
