      "review_date_formatted": "",
      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "After seeing this company install a large system at my workplace I approached them about a quote for my home. I was able to speak directly to the Company Director who was on the tools.  He was able to answer all my questions on the spot and the answers he gave were easily understandable.  Quote process was straight forward and the Sales Rep, Guy, promptly returned my calls, patiently answered all my questions, followed up promptly on any queries.  Installation was completed in the timeframe given.  It was fully explained to me that I would require a meter board upgrade, this was completed promptly & professionally prior to the solar installers coming to site.  Being a 1970's two storey brick home I thought I was going to have conduits on the outside wall.  The installers, Jared & Dale, went the extra mile and were able to get the conduits through an internal cavity from floor to roof so no conduits visible.  The 32 panel install was completed on my tile roof with minimum fuss, Dale took his time to do a thoroughly professional job, some slight changes to the design were required to optimise the inputs.  This was discussed with me and reasons explained.   Excellent service from start to finish including a follow up call a fortnight after install to check on the system, see if I had further queries.  Whilst on site the guys were very professional, kept a clean safe work environment, took all packaging off site.  Based on my experience, I have no hesitation in recommending Modergy to other people.  Whilst Modergy were not the cheapest option, after some of the horror stories I've heard, they were certainly worth the extra money.  You get what you pay for.",
